+      /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
+         UI POLISH LAYER
+         Placed last in this stylesheet so it wins the cascade. Purely visual /
+         accessibility refinements — no element is moved or hidden, so behaviour
+         is unchanged. Covers: keyboard focus rings, custom scrollbars, reduced-
+         motion support, depth on the banner, a cleaner active-tab treatment,
+         and a few small-screen tweaks.
+         ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
+
+      /* 1 ─ Visible keyboard focus. Only shows on keyboard navigation
+            (:focus-visible), never on mouse clicks, so it doesn't add noise for
